<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DMG ups AT&amp;T to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DMG ups AT&amp;T to buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it upgraded AT&amp;T Corp to buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- AT&amp;T gained 1/4 to 35-1/2.</p>
</text>
